        "testimonial_P9aHg3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you're looking for an unforgettable experience that’s as inspiring as it is indulgent, we can’t recommend Kiwi Cru’s wine tasting events enough. As a female-founded company specialising in exquisite New Zealand wines, Pippa has created something truly special. We highly recommend Pippa for creating the perfect meaningful event—whether it’s for work gatherings, social celebrations, or milestone moments.</p>",
            "author": "Georgia, Hera Clothing",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_GL9kig": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Pippa was such a wonderful host, she was very knowledgeable about all the wines and made it a fun learning experience about what we were tasting. But most importantly the wine selections were delicious! NZ wine is so underrated, I would recommend to anyone to try them.</p>",
